[S 605/2018 wef 01/10/2018]
[S 960/2021 wef 22/12/2021]
(9) In this regulation, unless the context otherwise requires, “measured value” means a value that is —
(a)measured directly; or
(b)derived from one or more measured variables relating to the following:
(i)where sub-paragraph (a) of paragraph (4A) applies —
(A)the quantity;
(B)the net calorific value; or
(C)the energy content value,
of each type of fuel or energy commodity mentioned in that sub-paragraph;
(ii)where paragraph (6) applies —
